    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>资源：22年某版本keep</p><p><a href="https://www.yuque.com/attachments/yuque/0/2025/zip/49117174/1742707696206-fedc4e5a-42d4-42bc-a249-f98a29e89ee0.zip">Keep_7.17.1.zip</a></p><h2 id="一、抓登录包，求签名算法"><a href="#一、抓登录包，求签名算法" class="headerlink" title="一、抓登录包，求签名算法"></a>一、抓登录包，求签名算法</h2><p><a href="https://www.yuque.com/attachments/yuque/0/2025/js/49117174/1742705817706-d36bd51f-572b-412c-9f97-8420f2d28ed4.js">aes_hook.js</a></p><h3 id="1、用frida脚本抓一下这个软件，然后登录："><a href="#1、用frida脚本抓一下这个软件，然后登录：" class="headerlink" title="1、用frida脚本抓一下这个软件，然后登录："></a>1、用frida脚本抓一下这个软件，然后登录：</h3><p><img src="https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2025/png/49117174/1742705923900-22377aa4-d74c-4c7c-b0fb-7aa178e1cfe5.png"></p><p>可以看到抓到了AES算法加密我们的账号与密码</p><p>用burp抓一下看看：</p><p><img src="https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2025/png/49117174/1742705999013-1b33ad87-1ebd-47da-a515-190a61ecebf6.png"></p><p>抓到的请求体就是刚刚aes hook到的数据</p><p>把数据拿去解密也是成功获得我们的输入</p><p><img src="https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2025/png/49117174/1742706151929-4e445e76-fabe-4755-9cf0-6dfd2d3f33ec.png"></p><p>接着看sign，像是一串md5加密数据，在我们的frida hook的输出终端找一下看看：</p><p><img src="https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2025/png/49117174/1742706283155-e94a43be-edc6-42b5-a0fc-67234760b561.png"></p><p>可以看到成功找到了一部分</p><p><img src="https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2025/png/49117174/1742706747389-11e178d0-0179-425e-89a1-61b67cef4b7a.png"></p><p>把update（update是java的md5加密算法的方法）后面的数据拿去md5也是成功还原</p><p>但再次检查我们的发包内容，可以看到sign不止我们刚刚的md5数据，还有多余8位字节的拼接</p><p><img src="https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2025/png/49117174/1742706865313-271fd60d-a945-4c6d-80f7-e71789b228bd.png"></p><p>现在我们的任务就是找到这里的八位字节的生成算法</p><p>思路：我这边还是用的frida来hook，当然也可以用字符串检索之类的，比如搜索login&#x2F;（抓包url），”sign”（发包一般用的hashmap）</p><h3 id="2、用frida脚本定位调用了update的位置"><a href="#2、用frida脚本定位调用了update的位置" class="headerlink" title="2、用frida脚本定位调用了update的位置"></a>2、用frida脚本定位调用了update的位置</h3><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br><span class="line">60</span><br><span class="line">61</span><br><span class="line">62</span><br><span class="line">63</span><br><span class="line">64</span><br><span class="line">65</span><br><span class="line">66</span><br><span class="line">67</span><br><span class="line">68</span><br><span class="line">69</span><br><span class="line">70</span><br><span class="line">71</span><br><span class="line">72</span><br><span class="line">73</span><br><span class="line">74</span><br><span class="line">75</span><br><span class="line">76</span><br><span class="line">77</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">function</span> <span class="title function_">callSign</span>(<span class="params"></span>)&#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="title class_">Java</span>.<span class="title function_">perform</span>(<span class="keyword">function</span> (<span class="params"></span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 获取MessageDigest类引用</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">var</span> <span class="title class_">MessageDigest</span> = <span class="title class_">Java</span>.<span class="title function_">use</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;java.security.MessageDigest&#x27;</span>);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// Hook所有重载的update方法</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">var</span> updateOverloads = <span class="title class_">MessageDigest</span>.<span class="property">update</span>.<span class="property">overloads</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    updateOverloads.<span class="title function_">forEach</span>(<span class="keyword">function</span> (<span class="params">overload</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        overload.<span class="property">implementation</span> = <span class="keyword">function</span> (<span class="params"></span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="comment">// 获取调用堆栈</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">var</span> stackTrace = <span class="title class_">Java</span>.<span class="title function_">use</span>(<span class="string">&quot;android.util.Log&quot;</span>).<span class="title function_">getStackTraceString</span>(</span><br><span class="line">                <span class="title class_">Java</span>.<span class="title function_">use</span>(<span class="string">&quot;java.lang.Exception&quot;</span>).$new()</span><br><span class="line">            );</span><br><span class="line">            </span><br><span class="line">            <span class="comment">// 过滤应用自身的调用（替换为你的目标包名）</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">var</span> appStack = stackTrace.<span class="title function_">split</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;\n&#x27;</span>).<span class="title function_">filter</span>(<span class="keyword">function</span> (<span class="params">line</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                <span class="keyword">return</span> line.<span class="title function_">includes</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;com.gotokeep.keep&#x27;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;).<span class="title function_">join</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;\n&#x27;</span>);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="comment">// 打印输入参数</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">var</span> args = [];</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="keyword">var</span> i = <span class="number">0</span>; i &lt; <span class="variable language_">arguments</span>.<span class="property">length</span>; i++) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                <span class="keyword">if</span> (<span class="variable language_">arguments</span>[i] <span class="keyword">instanceof</span> <span class="title class_">ArrayBuffer</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                    args.<span class="title function_">push</span>(<span class="title function_">bytesToHex</span>(<span class="variable language_">arguments</span>[i]));</span><br><span class="line">                &#125; <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                    args.<span class="title function_">push</span>(<span class="variable language_">arguments</span>[i]);</span><br><span class="line">                &#125;</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line">            </span><br><span class="line">            <span class="variable language_">console</span>.<span class="title function_">log</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;\n=== MD5 Update Called ===&#x27;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="variable language_">console</span>.<span class="title function_">log</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;Caller Stack:\n&#x27;</span> + appStack);</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="variable language_">console</span>.<span class="title function_">log</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;Arguments:&#x27;</span>, args);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="comment">// 调用原始方法</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="variable language_">this</span>.<span class="property">update</span>.<span class="title function_">apply</span>(<span class="variable language_">this</span>, <span class="variable language_">arguments</span>);</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// Hook digest方法获取最终结果</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="title class_">MessageDigest</span>.<span class="property">digest</span>.<span class="title function_">overload</span>().<span class="property">implementation</span> = <span class="keyword">function</span> (<span class="params"></span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">var</span> result = <span class="variable language_">this</span>.<span class="title function_">digest</span>();</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="variable language_">console</span>.<span class="title function_">log</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;\n=== MD5 Digest Result ===&#x27;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="variable language_">console</span>.<span class="title function_">log</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;Hex: &#x27;</span> + <span class="title function_">bytesToHex</span>(result));</span><br><span class="line">        </span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment">// 打印调用栈（同上）</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">var</span> stackTrace = <span class="title class_">Java</span>.<span class="title function_">use</span>(<span class="string">&quot;android.util.Log&quot;</span>).<span class="title function_">getStackTraceString</span>(</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="title class_">Java</span>.<span class="title function_">use</span>(<span class="string">&quot;java.lang.Exception&quot;</span>).$new()</span><br><span class="line">        );</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="variable language_">console</span>.<span class="title function_">log</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;Caller Stack:\n&#x27;</span> + <span class="title function_">filterStackTrace</span>(stackTrace));</span><br><span class="line">        </span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> result;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 字节数组转Hex工具函数</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">function</span> <span class="title function_">bytesToHex</span>(<span class="params">bytes</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">var</span> hex = [];</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="keyword">var</span> i = <span class="number">0</span>; i &lt; bytes.<span class="property">length</span>; i++) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            hex.<span class="title function_">push</span>((bytes[i] &gt;&gt;&gt; <span class="number">4</span>).<span class="title function_">toString</span>(<span class="number">16</span>));</span><br><span class="line">            hex.<span class="title function_">push</span>((bytes[i] &amp; <span class="number">0xF</span>).<span class="title function_">toString</span>(<span class="number">16</span>));</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> hex.<span class="title function_">join</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;&#x27;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 过滤堆栈工具函数</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">function</span> <span class="title function_">filterStackTrace</span>(<span class="params">stack</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> stack.<span class="title function_">split</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;\n&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">            .<span class="title function_">filter</span>(<span class="function"><span class="params">line</span> =&gt;</span> line.<span class="title function_">includes</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;com.gotokeep.keep&#x27;</span>))</span><br><span class="line">            .<span class="title function_">join</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;\n&#x27;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">function</span> <span class="title function_">filterStackTrace</span>(<span class="params">stack</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">      <span class="keyword">return</span> stack; <span class="comment">// 先输出完整堆栈</span></span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;);</span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="title function_">callSign</span>()</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2025/png/49117174/1742709194247-b10230d7-3bb0-499c-9b79-2ed03ab9c5ea.png"></p><p>找到了调用堆栈，分析调用链</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">1. 网络请求发起</span><br><span class="line">   ↓</span><br><span class="line">2. OkHttp拦截器链处理（`RealInterceptorChain`）</span><br><span class="line">   ↓</span><br><span class="line">3. 进入加密拦截器 `mi.b.intercept()`</span><br><span class="line">   ↓</span><br><span class="line">4. 拼接请求体+参数+密钥 → `sb2.toString()`</span><br><span class="line">   ↓</span><br><span class="line">5. 调用 `ld.z.e()` 生成MD5哈希</span><br><span class="line">   ↓</span><br><span class="line">6. 调用 `java.security.MessageDigest.digest()` 执行算法</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>找到mi.b.intercept</p><p><img src="https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2025/png/49117174/1742709261288-b0aa29e4-3db0-4332-b346-f16f9d9c09e1.png"></p><p>可以看到这就是我们要找到md5加密算法处，如果还不确定就用frida测一下这里的z.e(sb2.toString());的返回值</p><p><img src="https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2025/png/49117174/1742709395030-605ef3a1-5e1c-4822-b6b5-77951621e79a.png"></p><p>也是找对地方了</p><p>继续看代码</p><p>可以看到是把e13传入CrypLib.a方法获得返回值，然后就是我们的发包了</p><p>用frida调一下CrypLib.a的返回值</p><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">function</span> <span class="title function_">hook</span>(<span class="params"></span>)&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="title class_">Java</span>.<span class="title function_">perform</span>(<span class="keyword">function</span> (<span class="params"></span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">let</span> <span class="title class_">CrypLib</span> = <span class="title class_">Java</span>.<span class="title function_">use</span>(<span class="string">&quot;com.gotokeep.keep.common.utils.CrypLib&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line"><span class="title class_">CrypLib</span>[<span class="string">&quot;a&quot;</span>].<span class="property">implementation</span> = <span class="keyword">function</span> (<span class="params">str</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="variable language_">console</span>.<span class="title function_">log</span>(<span class="string">`CrypLib.a is called: str=<span class="subst">$&#123;str&#125;</span>`</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">let</span> result = <span class="variable language_">this</span>[<span class="string">&quot;a&quot;</span>](str);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="variable language_">console</span>.<span class="title function_">log</span>(<span class="string">`CrypLib.a result=<span class="subst">$&#123;result&#125;</span>`</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> result;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;)&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="title function_">hook</span>()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2025/png/49117174/1742709613855-0c0d7ebd-71b8-4215-8cf7-eaec22e67ec5.png"></p><p>可以看到和我们所想的一样，是把md5传入然后拼接一个字符串</p><p>现在有两个思路，一个是去ida分析这个加密算法，自己还原，二是用unidbg模拟执行这个so，我是懒b我选择后者</p><h3 id="unidbg模拟执行so"><a href="#unidbg模拟执行so" class="headerlink" title="unidbg模拟执行so"></a>unidbg模拟执行so</h3><figure class="highlight kotlin"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">package</span> com.gotokeep.keep</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> com.github.unidbg.AndroidEmulator</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> com.github.unidbg.arm.backend.Unicorn2Factory</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> com.github.unidbg.linux.android.AndroidEmulatorBuilder</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> com.github.unidbg.linux.android.AndroidResolver</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> com.github.unidbg.linux.android.dvm.*</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> java.io.File</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">internal</span> <span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">KeepHook</span> : <span class="type">AbstractJni</span>() &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">private</span> <span class="keyword">val</span> emulator: AndroidEmulator = AndroidEmulatorBuilder</span><br><span class="line">        .for32Bit()</span><br><span class="line">        .addBackendFactory(Unicorn2Factory(<span class="literal">true</span>))</span><br><span class="line">        .setProcessName(<span class="string">&quot;com.gotokeep.keep&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        .build()</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">private</span> <span class="keyword">val</span> KeepNative: DvmClass</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">private</span> <span class="keyword">val</span> vm: VM</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">init</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">val</span> memory = emulator.memory</span><br><span class="line">        memory.setLibraryResolver(AndroidResolver(<span class="number">23</span>))</span><br><span class="line">        vm = emulator.createDalvikVM(File(<span class="string">&quot;unidbg-android/src/test/resources/example_binaries/arm64-v8a/keep/Keep_7.17.1.apk&quot;</span>))</span><br><span class="line">        vm.setJni(<span class="keyword">this</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        vm.setVerbose(<span class="literal">false</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">val</span> dm = vm.loadLibrary(<span class="string">&quot;cryp&quot;</span>, <span class="literal">true</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        KeepNative = vm.resolveClass(<span class="string">&quot;com/gotokeep/keep/common/utils/CrypLib&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        dm.callJNI_OnLoad(emulator)</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="function"><span class="keyword">fun</span> <span class="title">calls</span><span class="params">()</span></span>: String &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">val</span> str = <span class="string">&quot;559cd1d027a5e555c2a13635e23f20b6&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">val</span> res = KeepNative.newObject(<span class="literal">null</span>).callJniMethodObject&lt;DvmObject&lt;*&gt;&gt;(emulator,</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="string">&quot;getEncryptDeviceId(Ljava/lang/String;)Ljava/lang/String;&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class="line">            str).value.toString()</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> res</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">override</span> <span class="function"><span class="keyword">fun</span> <span class="title">callStaticObjectMethod</span><span class="params">(</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"><span class="function">        vm: <span class="type">BaseVM</span>,</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"><span class="function">        dvmClass: <span class="type">DvmClass</span>?,</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"><span class="function">        signature: <span class="type">String</span>?,</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"><span class="function">        varArg: <span class="type">VarArg</span></span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"><span class="function">    )</span></span>: DvmObject&lt;*&gt; &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">when</span> (signature) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="string">&quot;com/gotokeep/keep/KApplication-&gt;getContext()Landroid/content/Context;&quot;</span> -&gt; &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                <span class="keyword">return</span> vm.resolveClass(<span class="string">&quot;android/content/Context&quot;</span>).newObject(<span class="literal">null</span>)</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="keyword">super</span>.callStaticObjectMethod(vm, dvmClass, signature, varArg)</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="keyword">fun</span> <span class="title">main</span><span class="params">()</span></span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">val</span> res = KeepHook()</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">val</span> result = res.calls()</span><br><span class="line">    println(<span class="string">&quot;call s result:<span class="variable">$result</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>直接套模板就行，中间会有 com&#x2F;gotokeep&#x2F;keep&#x2F;KApplication-&gt;getContext()Landroid&#x2F;content&#x2F;Context;</p><p>报错，这是因为unidbg不会加载context，修环境，实例化context就行</p><figure class="highlight kotlin"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">override</span> <span class="function"><span class="keyword">fun</span> <span class="title">callStaticObjectMethod</span><span class="params">(</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"><span class="function">    vm: <span class="type">BaseVM</span>,</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"><span class="function">    dvmClass: <span class="type">DvmClass</span>?,</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"><span class="function">    signature: <span class="type">String</span>?,</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"><span class="function">    varArg: <span class="type">VarArg</span></span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="params"><span class="function">)</span></span>: DvmObject&lt;*&gt; &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">when</span> (signature) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="string">&quot;com/gotokeep/keep/KApplication-&gt;getContext()Landroid/content/Context;&quot;</span> -&gt; &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">return</span> vm.resolveClass(<span class="string">&quot;android/content/Context&quot;</span>).newObject(<span class="literal">null</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="keyword">super</span>.callStaticObjectMethod(vm, dvmClass, signature, varArg)</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="发包相关"><a href="#发包相关" class="headerlink" title="发包相关"></a>发包相关</h2><p>经过分析可以发现只需要上传最后的数据就行，url是<a href="https://api.gotokeep.com/pd/v4/sportlog">https://api.gotokeep.com/pd/v4/sportlog</a></p><p>然后里面的请求体加密是base64+AES+Gzip和base64+Gzip，解密就行，最后造包，过程太麻烦了，让web手去做了</p>]]></content>
    
    
      
      
